     "design": {
      "purpose": "Choose the mean or the median to describe a data set from the shape of its dot plot.",
      "principles": [
       "PRINCIPLE_SELF_EXPLANATION"
      ],
      "rationale": "One plot is balanced and one has a value far from the rest. Students compute both measures first, so they see the far value pull the mean away from where most data sit. The written reason asks students to connect the choice to the shape of the plot.",
